  "description": "VUVKUU crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21. Reported CIF formula moiety: C80 H119 Gd5 N4 O27,C1 H4 O1,3(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Gd5 (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd3 (Gd) has 7 O neighbors; Gd4 (Gd) has 7 O neighbors; Gd2 (Gd) has 7 O neighbors; Gd1 (Gd) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.570-3.676 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 95.72-98.70°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C81H129Gd5N4O31.",
